docs: CT113 fully working end to end, NextPVR segmenter lead for AV-desync bug

- CT113: full fix chain documented (DNS, locks, libs, flags, gpu mode).
  qemu running, VNC confirmed reachable, Custom APK installed and
  launches clean on the emulator (no crash). Login step needs the owner
  (real Jellyfin credentials, not guessed/stored here).
- NextPVR: ChannelsUseSegmenter=False vs RecordingsUseSegmenter=True is
  a real, unproven-but-well-evidenced lead for the watch-while-recording
  desync/repeat bug. Next session should try toggling it first.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
